Run host regressions from the repository root:

    python3 test/run_native.py

Requires g++ (or CXX). Tests use fake hardware. AddressSanitizer and UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer errors
fail the run. CI runs these tests after building both firmware targets.

Coverage includes:
- bounded diagnostic logging with a disconnected or stalled USB host, a busy
  USB mutex, partial writes, ring wraparound, full queues, reentrant callers,
  message truncation, and per-category rate limiting across clock rollover;
- packet lengths, all fixed-field masks, duplicate/stale sequences, rollover,
  arbitrary initial sequences, watchdog resets, and control timing echoes;
- degree-to-servo round trips and analog/encoder boundary values;
